Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think it's a great point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:02.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,And maybe I'll just bring\Nup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:05.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,we wanted to talk a little\Nbit about technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:07.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I think that's a really\Nimportant part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,of where we are going in\Northopedic surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm part of a company on a\Ndesign team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:14.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,that they're personalizing\Nimplants,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,they 3D print the implant\Nfor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:22.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you imagine,\Nobviously, if you think that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:25.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,something's made specialized\Nto you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,it might be a little bit\Nmore tailored to you, your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:30.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,anatomy, your size, and\Nhopefully
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,that would just sort of get\Nyou in a better place,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,better outcome back to the\Ngym fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,or whatever it is, but\Nthat's where sort of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:39.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,technology's going.
